<view class="page" style="{{B}}"><view class="top-bar" style="{{'padding-top:' + b}}"><text class="back-text" bindtap="{{a}}">‹ 返回</text><text class="top-title">切换版本</text><text class="top-placeholder"></text></view><view class="hero-card" style="{{c}}"><text class="hero-title">普通版 / 校园版</text><text class="hero-desc"> 校园版会切换成青绿色，并优先给你推荐校园食堂和周边好吃的；普通版保持暖橙色风格。 </text></view><view class="mode-grid"><view class="mode-card" style="{{d}}" bindtap="{{e}}"><text class="mode-card__title">普通版</text><text class="mode-card__desc">保留暖橙色，推荐附近热门菜单</text></view><view class="mode-card" style="{{f}}" bindtap="{{g}}"><text class="mode-card__title">校园版</text><text class="mode-card__desc">切成青绿色，主打校内食堂和周边</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{h}}" class="section-card" style="{{w}}"><text class="section-title">当前已选校园</text><text class="section-desc">先显示你现在的选择，下面再按学校和校区慢慢挑</text><view class="current-campus-card" style="{{p}}"><view><view class="school-title-row"><text class="school-name">{{i}}</text><text wx:if="{{j}}" class="school-tag" style="{{l}}">{{k}}</text></view><text class="school-meta">{{m}} · {{n}}</text></view><text class="school-selected" style="{{o}}">已选择</text></view><view class="search-box"><text class="search-icon">🔎</text><input class="search-input" placeholder="搜索学校 / 校区 / 城市" placeholder-style="color:#b7ada4;font-size:24rpx;" value="{{q}}" bindinput="{{r}}"/></view><text class="section-title section-title--list">选择校园</text><text class="section-desc">校园越来越多时，先找学校，再展开选校区会更好找</text><view wx:if="{{s}}" class="school-list"><view wx:for="{{t}}" wx:for-item="group" wx:key="l" class="school-group" style="{{group.m}}"><view class="school-group__header" bindtap="{{group.h}}"><view class="school-group__content"><view class="school-title-row"><text class="school-name">{{group.a}}</text><text class="school-status" style="{{group.c}}">{{group.b}}</text></view><text class="school-meta">{{group.d}} · {{group.e}}</text><text class="school-tip">{{group.f}}</text></view><text class="school-arrow" style="{{v}}">{{group.g}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{group.i}}" class="campus-option-list"><view wx:for="{{group.j}}" wx:for-item="campus" wx:key="g" class="campus-option" style="{{campus.h}}" bindtap="{{campus.i}}"><view><view class="school-title-row"><text class="campus-option__title">{{campus.a}}</text><text wx:if="{{campus.b}}" class="campus-option__mini-tag" style="{{campus.c}}"> 校区 </text></view><text class="campus-option__meta">{{campus.d}} · {{campus.e}}</text></view><text class="campus-option__pick" style="{{group.k}}">{{campus.f}}</text></view></view></view></view><view wx:else class="empty-search"><text class="empty-search__title">没有搜到对应校园</text><text class="empty-search__desc">换个学校名、校区名或者城市关键词试试</text></view></view><button class="save-button" style="{{x}}" bindtap="{{y}}">保存当前选择</button><view class="join-card" style="{{z}}" bindtap="{{A}}"><text class="join-title">校园入驻功能</text><text class="join-desc">如果你的学校还没在列表里，可以马上提交入驻申请。</text></view></view>